    },
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t envy the evil",
          "or desire to be with them,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for their hearts plan violence,",
          "and their words stir up trouble."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A house is built by wisdom,",
          "and it is established by understanding;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "by knowledge the rooms are filled",
          "with every precious and beautiful treasure."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A wise warrior is better than a strong one,",
          "and a man of knowledge than one of strength; ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for you should wage war with sound guidance —",
          "victory comes with many counselors."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Wisdom is inaccessible to a fool;",
          "he does not open his mouth at the city gate."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The one who plots evil",
          "will be called a schemer."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A foolish scheme is sin,",
          "and a mocker is detestable to people."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If you do nothing in a difficult time,",
          "your strength is limited."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Rescue those being taken off to death,",
          "and save those stumbling toward slaughter."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If you say, “But we didn’t know about this,”",
          "won’t he who weighs hearts consider it?",
          "Won’t he who protects your life know?",
          "Won’t he repay a person according to his work?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Eat honey, my son, for it is good,",
          "and the honeycomb is sweet to your palate;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "realize that wisdom is the same for you.",
          "If you find it, you will have a future,",
          "and your hope will never fade."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t set an ambush, you wicked one,",
          "at the camp of the righteous man;",
          "don’t destroy his dwelling."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Though a righteous person falls seven times,",
          "he will get up,",
          "but the wicked will stumble into ruin."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t gloat when your enemy falls,",
          "and don’t let your heart rejoice when he stumbles,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "or the Lord will see, be displeased,",
          "and turn his wrath away from him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t be agitated by evildoers,",
          "and don’t envy the wicked."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the evil have no future;",
          "the lamp of the wicked will be put out."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My son, fear the Lord, as well as the king,",
          "and don’t associate with rebels,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for destruction will come suddenly from them;",
          "who knows what distress these two can bring?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These sayings also belong to the wise:",
          "It is not good to show partiality in judgment."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Whoever says to the guilty, “You are innocent” —",
          "peoples will curse him, and nations will denounce him;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "but it will go well with those who convict the guilty,",
          "and a generous blessing will come to them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He who gives an honest answer",
          "gives a kiss on the lips."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Complete your outdoor work, and prepare your field;",
          "afterward, build your house."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t testify against your neighbor without cause.",
          "Don’t deceive with your lips."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t say, “I’ll do to him what he did to me;",
          "I’ll repay the man for what he has done.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I went by the field of a slacker",
          "and by the vineyard of one lacking sense."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thistles had come up everywhere,",
          "weeds covered the ground,",
          "and the stone wall was ruined."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I saw, and took it to heart;",
          "I looked, and received instruction:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "a little sleep, a little slumber,",
          "a little folding of the arms to rest,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and your poverty will come like a robber,",
          "and your need, like a bandit."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
